---
title: Lemon Sauce
author: Mildred McKinzie
category: Sauces & Dressings
source: Loving Memories of Mildred
---

@sugar{1/2%c}
@cornstarch{1%Tbsp}
@boiling water{1%c}
@salt{1/8%tsp}
@nutmeg{1/8%tsp}
@butter{2%Tbsp}
@lemon juice{1.5%Tbsp}

Add last: 2 Tbsp butter and 1 1/2 Tbsp lemon juice
Cook slowly over low heat until thickened.
